  Registration:
  
   F3 Missile is *almost* freeware. Actually, it's "postcardware" 
   (or "emailware"). Here's the deal: Flying Muffin is trying to 
   build up its mailing list for the flight sim related things it 
   sells. We want your name and address so we can try to sell you 
   things in the future (but no salesman will call!). My mailing 
   list is strictly confidential unless you tell me otherwise. 
   
   If you've ever registered *anything* with me--or bought
   anything directly from me--in the past, then you don't have to 
   register F3 Missile; I've already got your name. But if you've 
   never sent me your name and address, please do so now. Use the 
   "register.doc" form included in this zip.
   
